{"parse":{"title":"Patch 5.4.7/API changes","pageid":549368,"revid":5298169,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"float: right; margin-left: 2em; margin-bottom: 1em;\"><div style=\"float: right; clear: right;\">\n<table class=\"darktable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Warcraft_Wiki:Interface_customization\" title=\"Warcraft Wiki:Interface customization\">Main Menu</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft_API\" title=\"World of Warcraft API\">WoW API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lua_functions\" title=\"Lua functions\">Lua API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Widget_API\" title=\"Widget API\">Widget API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/ScriptObject_API\" title=\"ScriptObject API\">ScriptObject API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/XML\" title=\"XML\">XML schema</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/FrameXML_functions\" title=\"FrameXML functions\">FrameXML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Events\" title=\"Events\">Events</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Console_variables\" title=\"Console variables\">CVars</a></li></ul>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/COMBAT_LOG_EVENT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"COMBAT LOG EVENT\">Combat Log</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/UI_escape_sequences\" title=\"UI escape sequences\">Escape sequences</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/API_change_summaries\" title=\"API change summaries\">API changes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/HOWTOs\" title=\"HOWTOs\">HOWTOs</a></li>\n<li><img alt=\"Warcraft Wiki icon stamp.svg\" src=\"/images/Warcraft_Wiki_icon_stamp.svg?c7645a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /> <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wiki.gg/redirect\">Redirect</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=warcraft.wiki.gg\">Google</a></span></li>\n<li><img alt=\"Discord logo.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Discord_logo.png/14px-Discord_logo.png?4d7bc2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Discord_logo.png/21px-Discord_logo.png?4d7bc2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Discord_logo.png/28px-Discord_logo.png?4d7bc2 2x\" data-file-width=\"619\" data-file-height=\"469\" /> <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/txUg39Vhc6\">WoWUIDev</a></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><table style=\"\" class=\"plainlinks ambox ambox-gray\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"ambox-image\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon-api-48x48.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon-api-48x48.png\" src=\"/images/Icon-api-48x48.png?6b6990\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></td>\n<td class=\"ambox-text\"><b>This article documents <a href=\"/wiki/API_change_summaries\" title=\"API change summaries\">API changes</a> made in <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_5.4.7\" title=\"Patch 5.4.7\">Patch 5.4.7</a>.</b>\n<ul><li>Previous patch: <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_5.4.2/API_changes\" title=\"Patch 5.4.2/API changes\">Patch 5.4.2</a>.</li>\n<li>Next patch: <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_5.4.8/API_changes\" title=\"Patch 5.4.8/API changes\">Patch 5.4.8</a>.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: right; margin-bottom: .5em; float: right; padding: .5em 0 .8em 1.4em; padding-left: min(1.4em, 2%); background: transparent; max-width: 20em;\" class=\"toc-socket\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Changes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Changes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Automated_diff\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Automated diff</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Global_API\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Global API</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Events\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Events</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes\">Changes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_5.4.7/API_changes?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Changes\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Event:CHAT_MSG_ADDON\" title=\"Event:CHAT MSG ADDON\">CHAT_MSG_ADDON</a> arg4's value for sender now returns player name - realm name instead of just the player name (e.g. \"Arthas-Silvermoon\")</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Event:CHAT_MSG_WHISPER\" title=\"Event:CHAT MSG WHISPER\">CHAT_MSG_WHISPER</a> arg2's value for author now returns player name - realm name instead of just the player name (e.g. \"Arthas-Silvermoon\")</li>\n<li>I haven't checked all other CHAT_MSG_* events but its not unlikely they will also include realm names</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Automated_diff\">Automated diff</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_5.4.7/API_changes?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Automated diff\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Global_API\">Global API</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_5.4.7/API_changes?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Global API\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"min-width: 600px\">\n<caption>Global API (5.4.2.17688 &#8594; 5.4.7.17956)\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr class=\"mw-customtoggle-global-c\" style=\"cursor: pointer\">\n<th style=\"padding: 0 1em;\">3 new functions\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-global-c\">\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"margin-left:-1.5em\">\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/API:BNGetFriendInviteInfoByAddon?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"API:BNGetFriendInviteInfoByAddon (page does not exist)\" rel=\"nofollow\">BNGetFriendInviteInfoByAddon</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/API:BNSendGameData\" title=\"API:BNSendGameData\">BNSendGameData</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/API:GetSpecializationNameForSpecID\" title=\"API:GetSpecializationNameForSpecID\">GetSpecializationNameForSpecID</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Events\">Events</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_5.4.7/API_changes?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Events\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"min-width: 600px\">\n<caption>Events (5.4.2.17688 &#8594; 5.4.7.17956)\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr class=\"mw-customtoggle-events\" style=\"cursor: pointer\">\n<th style=\"padding: 0 1em;\">6 new events\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-events\">\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"margin-left:-1.5em\">\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Event:AUTH_CHALLENGE_FINISHED?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Event:AUTH CHALLENGE FINISHED (page does not exist)\" rel=\"nofollow\">AUTH_CHALLENGE_FINISHED</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Event:BN_CHAT_MSG_ADDON\" title=\"Event:BN CHAT MSG ADDON\">BN_CHAT_MSG_ADDON</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Event:CHARACTER_UPGRADE_ABORTED?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Event:CHARACTER UPGRADE ABORTED (page does not exist)\" rel=\"nofollow\">CHARACTER_UPGRADE_ABORTED</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Event:CHARACTER_UPGRADE_COMPLETE?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Event:CHARACTER UPGRADE COMPLETE (page does not exist)\" rel=\"nofollow\">CHARACTER_UPGRADE_COMPLETE</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Event:CHARACTER_UPGRADE_STARTED?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Event:CHARACTER UPGRADE STARTED (page does not exist)\" rel=\"nofollow\">CHARACTER_UPGRADE_STARTED</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Event:PRODUCT_DISTRIBUTIONS_UPDATED?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Event:PRODUCT DISTRIBUTIONS UPDATED (page does not exist)\" rel=\"nofollow\">PRODUCT_DISTRIBUTIONS_UPDATED</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260926013423\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show\u2010toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.167 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 179/1000000\nRevision size: 1481/4194304 bytes\nPost\u2010expand include size: 4107/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 281/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 0/10000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/5000\nLua time usage: 0.007/15.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1039713/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  105.131      1 -total\n 73.86%   77.647     11 Template:Api\n 21.26%   22.354      1 Template:Apichanges\n  8.00%    8.409      1 Template:Ambox\n  4.33%    4.547      1 Template:Apinav\n  4.02%    4.230      1 Template:Tocright\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key warcraft_en:pcache:idhash:549368-0!canonical and timestamp 20260926013422 and revision id 5298169. Rendering was triggered because: 